    {
      "file": "scenes/scene-1.js",
      "narration": "Projectors wash out contrast, laptops shrink everything, and video adds compression. Choose fonts with open letter shapes, a generous x-height and solid strokes that hold up in all three.",
      "storyboard": "Ink stage with three screen frames side by side: a projector beam, a laptop, a video player. On 'wash out' the projector's sample letter 'a' fades grey; on 'shrink' the laptop's letter tiny; on 'compression' the video's letter turns blocky. Camera pushes into a single giant 'a' on paper: on 'open letter shapes' its counter glows teal, on 'x-height' a signal-yellow guide line rises, on 'solid strokes' the stems thicken. The letter returns crisp to all three screens. The four bullets are rebuilt as these three labelled callouts; 'distinct characters' is shown briefly as Il1 separating.",
      "minDuration": 12,
      "slide": {
        "title": "Pick fonts that survive tough screens",
        "text": "Open letter shapes. Generous x-height. Distinct characters. Solid strokes",
        "notes": "Projectors wash out contrast, laptops shrink everything and video adds compression. Choose fonts with open letter shapes, a generous x-height and solid strokes that hold up in all three.",
        "image": "assets/slide-2.png"
      },
